:false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.246,"vote_count":1238,"character":"Man on the Street (uncredited)","credit_id":"5e3799e5ac8e6b0015c6443f","order":85},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/vdoJZC5TBeUm5ohlxGcAhCo962a.jpg","genre_ids":[35],"id":679989,"title":"Po prostu czarny","original_language":"fr","original_title":"Tout simplement noir","overview":"Podczas organizacji protestu Jean-Pascal Zadi przygląda się dyskryminacji rasowej i swojej tożsamości czarnego Francuza przez satyryczny obiektyw.","popularity":1.5197,"poster_path":"/hYzYdsZJyBp3Rd6aLaTo5bp47iq.jpg","release_date":"2020-07-08","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.898,"vote_count":456,"character":"Mathieu Kassovitz","credit_id":"5e5e026e357c0000132d97be","order":4},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/2kpPVHLvkHfsc9uurzmEB1PoC6R.jpg","genre_ids":[10751,14,35,12],"id":2899,"title":"Asteriks i Obeliks: Misja Kleopatra","original_language":"fr","original_title":"Astérix & Obélix : Mission Cléopâtre","overview":"Boska Kleopatra chcąc utrzeć nosa Juliuszowi Cezarowi rzuca mu wyzwanie - jej lud w ciągu trzech miesięcy wybuduje najwspanialszy pałac na Ziemi, a Cezar przyzna, że Egipcianie to najpotężniejszy z narodów. Zadanie zostaje przydzielone Numernabisowi, który chcąc wypełnić swą misję zwraca się z prośbą o cudowny eliksir siły do swego starego przyjaciela Panoramiksa. W budowie swą pomoc oferują także Asteriks i Obeliks.","popularity":9.1419,"poster_path":"/8HmO58GsYJfW7iJ7mrqZ53vtHyt.jpg","release_date":"2002-01-30","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.367,"vote_count":3808,"character":"Banquet physiognomist","credit_id":"5eb041bdedeb43001fc8faf4","order":87},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/viGCwLxupyoaLsa6hrnu1gYrB0B.jpg","genre_ids":[18],"id":406,"title":"Nienawiść","original_language":"fr","original_title":"La Haine","overview":"24 godziny z życia trójki przyjaciół. Żyd Vinz, Arab Saïd oraz Murzyn Hubert mieszkają w jednym z blokowisk na paryskim przedmieściu. Jak większość mieszkańców tej dzielnicy, są bezrobotni, pozbawieni perspektyw i nadziei na lepsze jutro. Nuda i bezczynność często kończą się łamaniem prawa oraz potyczkami z policją. Kiedy chłopcy dowiadują się, że stróże prawa dotkliwie pobili ich kolegę, młodego Araba, postanawiają się zemścić. Nakręca się spirala przemocy. Chęć odwetu prowadzi do tragicznego epilogu.","popularity":10.6501,"poster_path":"/c1rh2XqyZyfw21oHmOl3GetrI2i.jpg","release_date":"1995-05-31","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":8.081,"vote_count":4620,"character":"Young Skin","credit_id":"5eae2a971a934f001ee988f3","order":32},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/1jnk4PUsaUzAGIiic5S9VEzYNgv.jpg","genre_ids":[99],"id":727887,"title":"Il était une fois... « La Haine »","original_language":"fr","original_title":"Il était une fois... « La Haine »","overview":"","popularity":0.83,"poster_path":"/i7ANPXFP0KV9sMwV8If9ndOF85.jpg","release_date":"2012-02-11","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.0,"vote_count":1,"character":"Self - Director","credit_id":"5f1ecb46511d09003774fd3e","order":1},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/tkf3lbyMdioLSk1pIjcKvWnvfUe.jpg","genre_ids":[35,18],"id":735716,"title":"Les méchants","original_language":"fr","original_title":"Les méchants","overview":"","popularity":0.9157,"poster_path":"/b2UC3Cp96yribP7od4ZZ76DguAT.jpg","release_date":"2021-09-08","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":4.101,"vote_count":114,"character":"Guillaume Kekchoz","credit_id":"5f41a997028f1400335d6dc2","order":5},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/qC3jmpKjt0cXkLiDv9YaGae899y.jpg","genre_ids":[18],"id":752070,"title":"Lui","original_language":"fr","original_title":"Lui","overview":"","popularity":1.3429,"poster_path":"/dcFvcNGymZyBAYeuSq2foc1JTki.jpg","release_date":"2021-10-27","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":4.489,"vote_count":95,"character":"Friend","credit_id":"5f82105602842000360d8f2f","order":2},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/xtErsvnl1DD8123cBUChCmr6zCI.jpg","genre_ids":[18],"id":756603,"title":"Oskarżony","original_language":"fr","original_title":"Les Choses humaines","overview":"Młody mężczyzna zostaje oskarżony o gwałt. Wkrótce pojawiają się liczne wątpliwości i pytania z tym związane. Czy rzeczywiście jest winny, a może sam jest ofiarą? Dwoje młodych bohaterów i ich bliscy zobaczą, jak ich życie i przekonania mogą zostać zniszczone, ale... czy prawda jest tylko jedna?","popularity":2.1788,"poster_path":"/63RyDr3e5fjT9r6YPCPmN2NAlIX.jpg","release_date":"2021-12-01","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.066,"vote_count":190,"character":"Prof. Adam Wizman","credit_id":"5f92db6676142100368ce028","order":3},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/uzxB1Gph1S51snKVkMQ1eX6qkI9.jpg","genre_ids":[18,36],"id":607394,"title":"The Way of the Wind","original_language":"de","original_title":"The Way of the Wind","overview":"","popularity":1.279,"poster_path":"/z0fY2kqjVEZvqvVf88iKu1RLzdk.jpg","release_date":"","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0,"character":"","credit_id":"5fc2528b3a340b003edc6c3c","order":35},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/h0ciCNe2n4yUmRKlrYpqYbMy52c.jpg","genre_ids":[35],"id":460184,"title":"Putain de porte","original_language":"fr","original_title":"Putain de porte","overview":"","popularity":0.8354,"poster_path":"/eC6XAh2iXKwrlHkvaNMp4cMc7h0.jpg","release_date":"1994-01-01","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.5,"vote_count":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6000f9bf6e938a003d7547c3","order":2},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/pRYrWzkFqtPUwfEXQcnyvSVRK81.jpg","genre_ids":[35,18,36],"id":2290,"title":"Jakub kłamca","original_language":"en","original_title":"Jakob the Liar","overview":"Polska, rok 1944. Jakub, żydowski sklepikarz, zostaje wezwany do kwatery głównej getta po złapaniu za wałęsanie się po godzinie policyjnej. Czekając na niemieckiego komendanta podsłuchuje niemieckiego komunikatu radiowego o ruchu wojsk rosyjskich. Po powrocie do getta dzieli się tą informacją z przyjacielem, a po getcie rozchodzi się plotka o ukrytym w getcie radiu.","popularity":2.842,"poster_path":"/vvwsvPyQFuQbKKfzNgoRhAcL5ml.jpg","release_date":"1999-09-16","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.701,"vote_count":410,"character":"Herschel","credit_id":"60a90d3bc6006d002a72ff59","order":10},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/x5GWEKfu1VKKlUWafaD5iT9ItzO.jpg","genre_ids":[99,10770],"id":837550,"title":"Jodie Foster - Hollywood dans la peau","original_language":"fr","original_title":"Jodie Foster - Hollywood dans la peau","overview":"","popularity":1.4062,"poster_path":"/jebdlRpJ2pHTcjTNKP8IDrvXeVm.jpg","release_date":"2021-04-03","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.475,"vote_count":20,"character":"Narrator (voice)","credit_id":"60bd40c7bfeb8b006f146641","order":6},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[],"id":838128,"title":"Tarubi, l'arabe strait 2","original_language":"fr","original_title":"Tarubi, l'arabe strait 2","overview":"","popularity":0.9402,"poster_path":"/wrOmLwasUndwCYskEyWMKzC8svG.jpg","release_date":"2001-01-01","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0,"character":"Le mec dans la voiture","credit_id":"60bf2867de11e5002955491a","order":3},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/agDfDLR6pUHK0VpNhhr8R399MUH.jpg","genre_ids":[99,36],"id":1363450,"title":"Apocalypse, Verdun","original_language":"fr","original_title":"Apocalypse, Verdun","overview":"","popularity":0.8619,"poster_path":"/95CuU94n7ltR9QyOvf6uGzYmKW4.jpg","release_date":"2016-02-21","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.1,"vote_count":8,"character":"Self - Narrator (voice)","credit_id":"66f90d940f6fa2cfce5f63e2","order":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[],"id":1409590,"title":"Avant... mais après","original_language":"fr","original_title":"Avant... mais après","overview":"","popularity":0.7194,"poster_path":"/1Osu2PgHkXWgvCDSQmMnFcLZOy7.jpg","release_date":"1994-01-01","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vo